     "description": "Ring draws on (0-1.4 s). Dot pulses on every beat, punches growing 108→124%, and the ring squeezes in toward the drop as anticipation.",
     "style": "Quad In into each hit, Expo Out back; no wordmark yet."
    },
    {
     "name": "Drop landing",
     "start": 4,
     "end": 4.6,
     "description": "At 4.0 s the ring bursts 112% and springs to 100; the dot overshoots to 150% and settles; first ripple leaves the mark; wordmark letters rise in from 4.1 s.",
     "style": "Spring Bouncy on the dot, Expo Out on the ripple, 0.05 s letter stagger."
    },
    {
     "name": "Secondary hits",
     "start": 4.6,
